{
  "id": "GAL.5",
  "number": "5",
  "bookId": "GAL",
  "reference": "Galatians 5",
  "verseCount": 26,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "5",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GAL 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For freedom did Christ set us free: stand fast therefore, and be not entangled again in a yoke of bondage.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, I Paul say unto you, that, if ye receive circumcision, Christ will profit you nothing. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yea, I testify again to every man that receiveth circumcision, that he is a debtor to do the whole law. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ye are severed from Christ, ye who would be justified by the law; ye are fallen away from grace. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For we through the Spirit by faith wait for the hope of righteousness. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For in Christ Jesus neither circumcision availeth anything, nor uncircumcision; but faith working through love. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ye were running well; who hindered you that ye should not obey the truth? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This persuasion ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " not of him that calleth you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A little leaven leaveneth the whole lump. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have confidence to you-ward in the Lord, that ye will be none otherwise minded: but he that troubleth you shall bear his judgment, whosoever he be. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But I, brethren, if I still preach circumcision, why am I still persecuted? then hath the stumbling-block of the cross been done away. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I would that they that unsettle you would even go beyond circumcision.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For ye, brethren, were called for freedom; only ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " not your freedom for an occasion to the flesh, but through love be servants one to another. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the whole law is fulfilled in one word, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " in this: Thou shalt love thy neighbor as thyself. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But if ye bite and devour one another, take heed that ye be not consumed one of another.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But I say, Walk by the Spirit, and ye shall not fulfil the lust of the flesh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the flesh lusteth against the Spirit, and the Spirit against the flesh; for these are contrary the one to the other; that ye may not do the things that ye would. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But if ye are led by the Spirit, ye are not under the law. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now the works of the flesh are manifest, which are ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ": fornication, uncleanness, lasciviousness, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "idolatry, sorcery, enmities, strife, jealousies, wraths, factions, divisions, parties, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "envyings, drunkenness, revellings, and such like; of which I forewarn you, even as I did forewarn you, that they who practise such things shall not inherit the kingdom of God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the fruit of the Spirit is love, joy, peace, longsuffering, kindness, goodness, faithfulness, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "meekness, self-control; against such there is no law. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they that are of Christ Jesus have crucified the flesh with the passions and the lusts thereof.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If we live by the Spirit, by the Spirit let us also walk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let us not become vainglorious, provoking one another, envying one another.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "GAL.6",
    "number": "6",
    "bookId": "GAL"
  },
